# CHRONICLE
## Master Engineering Specification
**Version:** 1.0  
**Date:** 8 November 2026  
**Status:** Approved architectural baseline, pending implementation  
**Product:** Chronicle, Project Knowledge Reconstruction & Handover Intelligence

