1. Ingest sources.
2. Reconstruct project history.
3. Verify evidence.
4. Resolve conflicts.
5. Complete knowledge-gap interviews.
6. Inspect dependency and ownership graph.
7. Generate and lock handover.
8. Verify integrity and acknowledge receipt.

