9. Document unresolved issues.
10. Provide a clear handover for the next task.

### Handover format

```text
TASK:
STATUS:

FILES CREATED:
FILES MODIFIED:

IMPLEMENTATION SUMMARY:

TESTS EXECUTED:
TEST RESULTS:

KNOWN ISSUES:

ARCHITECTURAL DEVIATIONS:
NONE / EXPLAIN

NEXT RECOMMENDED TASK:
```

No agent may silently skip a failed test or conceal a known limitation.

